              alt="외단열시스템 구조도"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <figcaption>외단열시스템</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="ac-struct-fig">
            <img
              src="/images/eifs-structure-coating.jpg"
              alt="외벽불연도막시스템 구조도"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <figcaption>외벽불연도막시스템</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-features" id="features">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Features</span>
          <h2>아쿠아크리트 외단열 특징</h2>
          <p>외벽에 요구되는 핵심 성능을 한눈에 확인해 보세요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-fgrid">
          <article class="ac-fcard is-signature ac-reveal" data-d="1">
