    <div class="margin-page">
      <section class="ac-sec ac-concept" id="concept">
        <div class="ac-concept__grid">
          <div class="ac-concept__aside ac-reveal">
            <span class="ac-eyebrow">Concept</span>
            <h2>Non-Combustible<br />Aqua-Crete EIFS</h2>
            <div class="ac-keychips">
              <span class="ac-keychip">100% inorganic</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">GORE-TEX® function</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">Strong adhesion</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">Odor &amp; dust free</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ac-concept__body ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <p>Using a powder binder composed of 100% inorganic non-combustible
              ingredients and a water-based liquid, Aqua-Crete is applied to
              building substrates (concrete, cement mortar, masonry, tile, EIFS
              finishes) by plastering or spray application — on both dry and
              fully saturated surfaces (100% moisture content).</p>
            <p>The NEP-certified non-combustible Aqua-Crete uses 100% fireproof
              materials that do not burn and produce no toxic gases during fire.
              It offers excellent breathability and waterproofing (GORE-TEX
              function), generates no odor or dust during application, and
              delivers strong adhesion to the substrate as an inorganic
              non-combustible waterproof finish.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-firetest-sec" id="firetest">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Fire Safety</span>
          <h2>KS F 8414 Full-Scale Fire Test</h2>
          <p>Korean industrial standard full-scale fire test verifying exterior
            finish fire safety.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-firetest2 ac-reveal" data-d="1">
          <figure class="ac-firetest2__fig">
            <img
              src="/images/eifs-firetest.jpg"
              alt="KS F 8414 full-scale fire test — ignition, Level 1 and Level 2 temperature measurement"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </figure>
          <div class="ac-firetest2__body">
            <h3>An inorganic non-combustible facade that blocks flame spread</h3>
            <p>The KS F 8414 full-scale fire test reproduces a real fire to
              evaluate how an exterior finish resists fire spread. The
              Aqua-Crete EIFS is a certified product that satisfies both
              evaluation criteria below.</p>
            <div class="ac-firetest2__crit">
              <div class="ac-firetest2__card">
                <h4>1. External Fire Spread Evaluation</h4>
                <p>Within 15 minutes from test start, the specimen temperature
                  at Level 2 (5m above the opening) must not exceed 600°C at any
                  external thermocouple point for more than 30 seconds.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ac-firetest2__card">
                <h4>2. Internal Fire Spread Evaluation</h4>
                <p>Within 15 minutes from test start, the specimen temperature
                  at Level 2 (5m above the opening) must not exceed 600°C at any
                  internal thermocouple point for more than 30 seconds.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

