          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Features</span>
          <h2>Key Features</h2>
          <p>Core performance capabilities for exterior wall applications.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-fgrid">
          <article class="ac-fcard is-signature ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
                  d="M12 3s5 4.5 5 9a5 5 0 0 1-10 0c0-1.6.6-3 1.4-4.2"
